       act_dep_time,
       COALESCE(act_dep_time, '1900-01-01 00:00:00') AS handled_act_dep_time
   FROM your_table;
   ```

4. **Remove Extra Characters**: Remove any extra characters from the "act_dep_time" column to ensure consistency.

   ```sql
   SELECT 
       act_dep_time,
       REGEXP_REPLACE(act_dep_time, '[^0-9:]') AS cleaned_act_dep_time
   FROM your_table;
